Most teams are fully live on Northline within a week.

- **Day 1-2** — workspace setup, inbox connection, and importing existing open tickets (CSV or migration connector) [1].
- **Day 3** — routing rules and SLA targets configured per queue [1].
- **Day 4** — additional channels (web form, Slack) connected and broader team invited [1].
- **Day 5** — go live, with the old inbox/tracker switched to read-only [1].

Business and Enterprise plans include a free onboarding specialist for the first 30 days, while Team-plan customers get guided docs and email support [1].

See [Pricing plans](https://northline.com/pricing) for plan details, and check https://northline.com/integrations for channel setup info.